{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This line graph represents the price of a trading card during the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> months of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/5/a45fabf5c3fa51caa9ab513719e62d0bb8f95157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1993$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/510eda47335b6f0d733f6e02a5c7312db8b5a22d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); for (int a = 0; a &lt;= 6; ++a) {     draw((4*a,0)--(4*a,10)); } for (int a = 0; a &lt;= 5; ++a) {     draw((0,2*a)--(24,2*a)); } draw((0,5)--(4,4)--(8,8)--(12,3)--(16,9)--(20,6)--(24,2),linewidth(1.5));  label(&quot;$Jan$&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;$Feb$&quot;,(6,0),S); label(&quot;$Mar$&quot;,(10,0),S); label(&quot;$Apr$&quot;,(14,0),S); label(&quot;$May$&quot;,(18,0),S); label(&quot;$Jun$&quot;,(22,0),S); label(&quot;$\\textbf{1993 PRICES FOR A TRADING CARD}$&quot;,(12,10),N);  label(&quot;$\\textbf{Price}$&quot;,(-2, 6),N); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(0,2),W); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(0,4),W); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(0,6),W); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(0,8),W); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(0,10),W); [/asy]\" width=\"812\" height=\"348\" />\n</p><p>The greatest monthly drop in price occurred during\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78769cd0788a3a5687dc1c6039f467317a5a018e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{January} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{March} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{April} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{May} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{June}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"492\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph shows the following price changes:\n</p><p>Jan: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/f/fef895bed0f20ee7178b74801158b2af794a42b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-0.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Feb: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/b/97ba575b410f6097cd3f4ce670785b7bb466a0b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+2.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Mar: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/e/23eaf36b3768fc0993f0babb1550471796e27e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Apr: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/b/c0b23ce28a791c4845a872846fc73b2df36dff70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+3.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>May: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/f/fef895bed0f20ee7178b74801158b2af794a42b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-0.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Jun: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e4eb99351297cd8d3ff057c7882afc8a43b55e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d8f492ccfb79f1d9a8703efd907df3736918f19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ \\text{March}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"88\" height=\"28\" /> has the largest price drop.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_P